    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n71155" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νυκτέλιος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νύξ</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>nightly,</i> epith. of Dionysus, from his <i>nightly
				festivals,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				AP
				9.524.14
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.389a
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Paus.
				1.40.6
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νυκτέλιον, τό,</span>
			<i>night-festival,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἴσιδος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>POxy.</u>
					525
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(ii A.D.)</span>: in pl., <i>festival of</i> Dionysus
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Νυκτέλιος,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.291a
			</span></i>.</div>
